{"seq":51,"slug":"infrastructure-as-code","title":"基础设施即代码","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/infrastructure-as-code","rating":{"composite":3.94,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"基础设施即代码\">基础设施即代码</h1><p>二十年前，搭一套生产环境意味着一名工程师对着 SSH 终端，凭记忆敲命令、改配置、装软件包，再把步骤潦草记在一份逐渐过时的 Wiki 里。环境之间的细微差异最终演变成&quot;在我机器上是好的&quot;这类难以复现的故障。基础设施即代码（Infrastructure as Code，IaC）就是对这种混乱的彻底回应：把服务器、网络、数据库、负载均衡器这些原本靠手工操作的资源，写成可以版本控制、可以评审、可以自动执行的代码。基础设施从此和应用代码享有同一套工程纪律——分支、Pull Request、CI 流水线、回滚。</p>\n<p>这个 hub 沿着一条由浅入深的主线展开，四个章节层层递进，每一层都建立在前一层之上。</p>\n<p>第一章「基础」回答&quot;为什么&quot;和&quot;是什么&quot;。它讲清 IaC 的核心价值（可复现、可审计、可协作），剖析声明式与命令式两种范式的根本差异，并引入贯穿全 hub 的两个心智模型——期望状态与幂等性，以及它们的反面：配置漂移。这一层是地基，后面所有机制都是为了把这些原则落到工程现实中。</p>\n<p>第二章「核心机制」回答&quot;靠什么运转&quot;。声明式工具要知道&quot;现在是什么样&quot;才能算出&quot;该改什么&quot;，于是有了状态文件，以及围绕状态的锁、远端后端、加密。工具要按正确顺序创建资源，于是有了依赖图。要让配置不沦为复制粘贴的灾难，于是有了模块与组合。这三件事是 IaC 从玩具走向规模化的关键。</p>\n<p>第三章「工具生态」回答&quot;用什么工具&quot;。从供应工具（Terraform、OpenTofu、Pulumi）到配置管理（Ansible），再到把 Kubernetes 控制平面变成通用 IaC 引擎的 Crossplane，本章勾勒出一条工具光谱，并讲清每种工具适合解决哪一类问题。</p>\n<p>第四章「工程实践」回答&quot;如何在团队里可靠地用&quot;。测试与校验防止坏代码进入生产，策略即代码用自动化护栏取代人工审批，协作工作流与 CI/CD 把前三章的一切编织进日常的 Pull Request 节奏。这一层是生产收口——没有它，IaC 只是把手工混乱搬进了代码仓库。</p>\n<p>读完整个 hub，你会得到的不只是某个工具的用法，而是一套关于&quot;如何把基础设施当软件来工程化&quot;的完整心智框架。建议从第一章顺序读起，因为后面每一章都默认你已经内化了前面的概念。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/infrastructure-as-code/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"iac-principles","title":"基础设施即代码的原理与价值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/infrastructure-as-code/foundations/iac-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"declarative-vs-imperative","title":"声明式与命令式：期望状态模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/infrastructure-as-code/foundations/declarative-vs-imperative"},{"seq":3,"slug":"idempotency-drift","title":"幂等性与配置漂移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/infrastructure-as-code/foundations/idempotency-drift"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"core-mechanics","title":"核心机制","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/infrastructure-as-code/core-mechanics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"state-management","title":"状态管理：状态文件、锁与远端后端","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/infrastructure-as-code/core-mechanics/state-management"},{"seq":2,"slug":"resource-dependencies","title":"资源依赖与依赖图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/infrastructure-as-code/core-mechanics/resource-dependencies"},{"seq":3,"slug":"modules-reuse","title":"模块、组合与复用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/infrastructure-as-code/core-mechanics/modules-reuse"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"tooling","title":"工具生态","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/infrastructure-as-code/tooling","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"provisioning-tools","title":"供应工具：Terraform、OpenTofu 与 Pulumi","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/infrastructure-as-code/tooling/provisioning-tools"},{"seq":2,"slug":"config-management","title":"配置管理：Ansible 与可变基础设施","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/infrastructure-as-code/tooling/config-management"},{"seq":3,"slug":"kubernetes-iac","title":"Kubernetes 声明式与 Crossplane","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/infrastructure-as-code/tooling/kubernetes-iac"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practices","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/infrastructure-as-code/practices","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"testing-validation","title":"IaC 的测试与校验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/infrastructure-as-code/practices/testing-validation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"policy-as-code","title":"策略即代码：OPA 与合规护栏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/infrastructure-as-code/practices/policy-as-code"},{"seq":3,"slug":"collaboration-workflows","title":"协作工作流与 IaC 的 CI/CD","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/infrastructure-as-code/practices/collaboration-workflows"}]}]}